diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..95e8fc2 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -40,6 +40,14 @@ bin/dev # You need to start the dev server in the same terminal session
 
 This will ask for your 1password authorization to read and set the environment variables that Stripe needs.
 
+### How billing works
+
+Plans live in `app/models/plan.rb`: Free (1,000 cards, 1 GB), Unlimited ($20/month, 5 GB) and Unlimited+ ($25/month, 500 GB). The paid plans map to Stripe prices through `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID` and `STRIPE_MONTHLY_EXTRA_STORAGE_V1_PRICE_ID`.
+
+Admins upgrade from account settings. Free accounts go through Stripe Checkout; subscribed accounts confirm plan changes, and manage payment details and cancellation, in the Stripe customer portal, so the portal must allow switching between the two prices. Stripe reports subscription changes to `POST /stripe/webhooks`, signed with `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`. The endpoint needs the `customer.subscription.created`, `.updated`, `.deleted`, `.paused` and `.resumed` events.
+
+Support tools are at `/admin/accounts`: comping an account gives it Unlimited for free, and overriding the card count or bytes used bills the account on those numbers instead of its real usage until reset.
+
 ### Stripe environments
 
 * [Development](https://dashboard.stripe.com/acct_1SdTFtRus34tgjsJ/test/dashboard)
